{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026gEIKs3Egxs1795352069.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>韓國高考共發現111宗與智能設備有關的作弊，教育部長就應對近日的AI作弊風波引起混亂請辭。</p><p></p><p>韓國教育部指，除了5宗使用包括AI眼鏡等智能裝置作弊的個案，其餘作弊都涉及考生未有交出手機或智能裝置，當中54宗透過發送緊急災難警報短信查出，52宗透過探測WIFI等方式查出。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.SK.EXAM-1930.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026OgZ2yKyqAf1795352079.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>韓國高考在本月19日舉行，受開考前4日，稅務師考試狀元利用AI作弊的事件影響，當局臨時採取了多項防範措施，包括首次以防止考試作弊為目的，向全國手機發送無法拒收的緊急災難警報短信。</p><p></p><p>教育部長崔教振表示，臨時措施為考生和廣大市民帶來不便，現在考試已經結束，深感責任重大，因此決定辭職。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T14:03:54.147049+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":275,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T12:35:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T14:08:50.343181+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T13:57:19.701881+00:00","content_hash":"91a2a065dfa2ea69e586e8ebd960f6bd25857fd9785a665817077914d240bc32","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-22T14:03:54.147049+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}